{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119841","id":3760951580,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7gK5Ec","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119841","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119841.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119841.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119841","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119841/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119841/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119841/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/149a34a86bd8e2d4c3532a31916603604f48badf","number":119841,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Label and RichTextLabel: Fix updating `visible_*` when text changes.","user":{"login":"mgiuca","id":228433,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODQzMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228433?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca","html_url":"https://github.com/mgiuca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Label: Always recalculate visible_characters (from visible_ratio) when text changes. (Previously, it did not change visible_chars when visible_ratio >= 1.0, resulting in invalid state.)\r\n\r\nRichTextLabel: Recalculate visible_ratio (from visible_characters) when text changes. (Previously, it did not update at all.) This is intentionally different to Label for backwards compatibility.\r\n\r\nOther misc related changes:\r\n\r\n- When computing visible_ratio from visible_characters, clamp the value between 0.0 and 1.0 (matching the behaviour of the visible_ratio setter). This does not affect the text rendering.\r\n- RichTextLabel: When computing visible_ratio from visible_characters, if text length is zero, set visible_ratio to 1.0 rather than leaving unchanged (consistent with Label).\r\n\r\nAdded a full test suite covering the above changes.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #119837\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nI kept (as close as possible) the discrepancy between `Label` and `RichTextLabel` discussed in #119840 (and explcitly tested this difference in the test suite). It can easily be modified for consistency but I wanted to make minimal breaking changes with this PR.\r\n\r\nSince this is fixing a long-standing non-regression bug, I assume we'll wait until 4.7 is out and try to get this into 4.8.","lab